        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86416, Curved Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSure to bring a smile to any home owner's face, the Curve Bar Cabinet Pull can be mounted either vertically or horizontally. This modern kitchen cabinet pull is available in 3 sizes and 5 finishes. The Curved Cabinet Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86416-specifications.gif?v=1704354778\" width=\"600\" height=\"136\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86416 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/t-curve-cabinet-pull-emtek-86415\"><b>T-Curve Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Curve Bar Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86416-specifications.pdf?v=1704262405\"><b>Emtek Curve Bar Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86416:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86417:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86418:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-mod-86415-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354683\" width=\"427\" height=\"109\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
